  "description": "Get ready for your holiday gathering with these beautiful, editable rustic Christmas party templates. This instant download is fully customizable in Canva, allowing you to easily add your own details, change fonts, and colors to match your event theme. Perfect for a farmhouse-style Christmas celebration!\nYou will receive:\n* A Pdf with links to your templates\n* Edit the wording, images are not editable\nThis set includes:\n* 5×7 Invitation\n* Mobile invitation – 1080×1920 inches\n* Menu – in sizes 2×9 inches and 5×7 inches\n* Food labels/place cards – 3.5×4 inches (when folded), 3.5×2 and U.S letter size (6 designs)\n* Chocolate wrapper – 5.2×6 inches (fits a 1.55oz chocolate bar)\n* Thank you tags – 2×3.5 inches – 5 designs\n* Party signs – in sizes 16×20, 18×24 and 24×36 inches\n* Wine bottle labels –  3.5×4 inches\nHow it works:\n* Click on the links in the downloadable pdf \n* If you do not have a Canva account you can create one for free.\n* Download at the top right, click on “share”, choose either pdf, jpeg or png.\nPlease note: pdf print yields the best print results.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Get ready for your holiday gathering with these beautiful, editable rustic Christmas party templates. This instant download is fully customizable in Canva, allowing you to easily add your own details, change fonts, and colors to match your event theme. Perfect for a farmhouse-style Christmas celebration!</p>\n<p>You will receive:</p>\n<p>* A Pdf with links to your templates<br>\n* Edit the wording, images are not editable</p>\n<p>This set includes:<br>\n* 5×7 Invitation<br>\n* Mobile invitation – 1080×1920 inches<br>\n* Menu – in sizes 2×9 inches and 5×7 inches<br>\n* Food labels/place cards – 3.5×4 inches (when folded), 3.5×2 and U.S letter size (6 designs)<br>\n* Chocolate wrapper – 5.2×6 inches (fits a 1.55oz chocolate bar)<br>\n* Thank you tags – 2×3.5 inches – 5 designs<br>\n* Party signs – in sizes 16×20, 18×24 and 24×36 inches<br>\n* Wine bottle labels –  3.5×4 inches</p>\n<p>How it works:</p>\n<p>* Click on the links in the downloadable pdf </p>\n<p>* If you do not have a Canva account you can create one for free.</p>\n<p>* Download at the top right, click on “share”, choose either pdf, jpeg or png.</p>\n<p>Please note: pdf print yields the best print results.</p>",
